---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Our Process | Lotus Technologies"
	description="See how Lotus Technologies works collaboratively with clients from discovery through launch and support."
>
	<div class="process-page">
		<section class="process-hero">
			<div class="process-hero-inner">
				<p class="process-eyebrow">Our Process</p>
				<h1>Two teams. <span>One goal.</span></h1>
				<p>
					Great solutions are built with clients, not handed to them at the end. Lotus keeps your team involved from the first requirements conversation through design, development, testing, launch, and ongoing support.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="process-principles" aria-label="Process principles">
			<div class="process-principle"><strong>Shared ownership</strong><span>Your team helps shape priorities, requirements, and decisions throughout the project.</span></div>
			<div class="process-principle"><strong>Visible progress</strong><span>You see working designs and functionality while there is still time to influence them.</span></div>
			<div class="process-principle"><strong>Built-in approval</strong><span>Review and approval checkpoints keep scope, expectations, and outcomes aligned.</span></div>
			<div class="process-principle"><strong>Success after launch</strong><span>Deployment is a milestone, not the end of the relationship.</span></div>
		</section>

		<section class="process-map-section">
			<div class="process-map-intro">
				<p class="process-eyebrow">The Workflow</p>
				<h2 style="color:#4DA3FF">FORWARD PROGRESS IS <span>EARNED</span></h2>
				<p>Every major stage includes review and feedback. When something needs to change, the process visibly loops back before moving forward again.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="process-visual" aria-label="Lotus and client collaborative workflow">
				<div class="process-visual-legend" aria-hidden="true">
					<span class="legend-lotus"><i></i> Lotus Team</span>
					<span class="legend-client"><i></i> Client Team</span>
					<span class="legend-loop">↶ Iteration / revision</span>
				</div>

				<svg class="process-flow-desktop" viewBox="0 0 1260 470" role="img" aria-labelledby="workflow-title workflow-desc">
					<title id="workflow-title">Two-team iterative development workflow</title>
					<desc id="workflow-desc">Lotus and client teams move together through Discover, Design, Build, Validate, and Launch, with visible feedback loops returning work to earlier stages when review or testing identifies changes.</desc>
					<defs>
						<linearGradient id="lotusRail" x1="0" x2="1"><stop stop-color="#296fe8"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#58b8ff"/></linearGradient>
						<linearGradient id="clientRail" x1="0" x2="1"><stop stop-color="#d99a25"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ffd36f"/></linearGradient>
						<filter id="softGlow" x="-50%" y="-50%" width="200%" height="200%"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="5" result="b"/><feMerge><feMergeNode in="b"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge></filter>
						<marker id="arrowBlue" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L9 4.5L0 9Z" fill="#58b8ff"/></marker>
						<marker id="arrowGold" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L9 4.5L0 9Z" fill="#f2b84b"/></marker>
						<marker id="arrowLoop" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L9 4.5L0 9Z" fill="#9fd8ff"/></marker>
					</defs>

					<path class="flow-rail lotus-rail" d="M100 165H1160" marker-end="url(#arrowBlue)"/>
					<path class="flow-rail client-rail" d="M100 315H1160" marker-end="url(#arrowGold)"/>

					<g class="stage-node" transform="translate(135 0)">
						<text class="stage-number" x="0" y="67">01</text><text class="stage-label" x="42" y="67">DISCOVER</text>
						<rect class="lotus-box" x="0" y="105" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title" x="18" y="136">Understand</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="158">requirements + goals</text>
						<rect class="client-box" x="0" y="270" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title gold" x="18" y="301">Share</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="323">vision + priorities</text>
						<path class="handoff" d="M85 189V270"/><circle class="checkpoint" cx="85" cy="230" r="16"/><path class="checkmark" d="M77 230l6 6 11-13"/>
					</g>

					<g class="stage-node" transform="translate(365 0)">
						<text class="stage-number" x="0" y="67">02</text><text class="stage-label" x="42" y="67">DESIGN</text>
						<rect class="lotus-box" x="0" y="105" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title" x="18" y="136">Design</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="158">solution + architecture</text>
						<rect class="client-box" x="0" y="270" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title gold" x="18" y="301">Review</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="323">mockups + workflow</text>
						<path class="handoff" d="M85 189V270"/><circle class="checkpoint" cx="85" cy="230" r="16"/><path class="checkmark" d="M77 230l6 6 11-13"/>
					</g>

					<g class="stage-node" transform="translate(595 0)">
						<text class="stage-number" x="0" y="67">03</text><text class="stage-label" x="42" y="67">BUILD</text>
						<rect class="lotus-box" x="0" y="105" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title" x="18" y="136">Build</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="158">code + internal QA</text>
						<rect class="client-box" x="0" y="270" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title gold" x="18" y="301">Review</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="323">working progress</text>
						<path class="handoff" d="M85 189V270"/><circle class="checkpoint" cx="85" cy="230" r="16"/><path class="checkmark" d="M77 230l6 6 11-13"/>
					</g>

					<g class="stage-node" transform="translate(825 0)">
						<text class="stage-number" x="0" y="67">04</text><text class="stage-label" x="42" y="67">VALIDATE</text>
						<rect class="lotus-box" x="0" y="105" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title" x="18" y="136">Refine</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="158">fix + retest</text>
						<rect class="client-box" x="0" y="270" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title gold" x="18" y="301">Test</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="323">validate real workflow</text>
						<path class="handoff" d="M85 189V270"/><circle class="checkpoint" cx="85" cy="230" r="16"/><path class="checkmark" d="M77 230l6 6 11-13"/>
					</g>

					<g class="stage-node" transform="translate(1055 0)">
						<text class="stage-number" x="0" y="67">05</text><text class="stage-label" x="42" y="67">LAUNCH</text>
						<rect class="lotus-box" x="0" y="105" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title" x="18" y="136">Deploy</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="158">train + support</text>
						<rect class="client-box" x="0" y="270" width="170" height="84" rx="18"/><text class="box-title gold" x="18" y="301">Adopt</text><text class="box-sub" x="18" y="323">measure + improve</text>
						<path class="handoff" d="M85 189V270"/><circle class="checkpoint final" cx="85" cy="230" r="16"/><path class="checkmark" d="M77 230l6 6 11-13"/>
					</g>

					<path class="return-loop loop-design" d="M450 270C450 395 250 402 220 275" marker-end="url(#arrowLoop)"/>
					<text class="loop-label" x="268" y="420">DESIGN REVIEW → REVISE</text>
					<path class="return-loop loop-build" d="M680 270C680 438 470 448 450 278" marker-end="url(#arrowLoop)"/>
					<text class="loop-label" x="492" y="454">PROGRESS REVIEW → REFINE</text>
					<path class="return-loop major-loop" d="M910 270C910 110 700 78 680 105" marker-end="url(#arrowLoop)"/>
					<text class="loop-label major" x="708" y="91">CLIENT TESTING → BACK TO BUILD</text>
					<path class="return-loop launch-loop" d="M1140 270C1140 88 930 64 910 105" marker-end="url(#arrowLoop)"/>
					<text class="loop-label major" x="948" y="52">FINAL REVIEW → REFINE BEFORE LAUNCH</text>
				</svg>

				<div class="process-mobile-flow" aria-hidden="true">
					<div><b>01</b><strong>Discover</strong><span>Lotus understands ↕ Client shares</span></div>
					<i>↓</i>
					<div><b>02</b><strong>Design</strong><span>Lotus designs ↕ Client reviews</span><em>↶ revise when needed</em></div>
					<i>↓</i>
					<div><b>03</b><strong>Build</strong><span>Lotus builds ↕ Client reviews progress</span><em>↶ refine when needed</em></div>
					<i>↓</i>
					<div><b>04</b><strong>Validate</strong><span>Lotus refines ↕ Client tests</span><em>↶ testing can return work to Build</em></div>
					<i>↓</i>
					<div><b>05</b><strong>Launch & Support</strong><span>Lotus deploys ↕ Client adopts</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="process-why">
			<div>
				<p class="process-eyebrow">Why It Works</p>
				<h2>Fewer surprises. Better decisions.</h2>
				<p class="process-why-copy">The process keeps technical execution tied to the business problem. Feedback happens while it can still change the outcome, and review is part of the workflow—not an event saved for the end.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="process-why-grid">
				<div class="process-why-card"><strong>Feedback happens early</strong><span>Changes are cheaper and easier during design and development than after launch.</span></div>
				<div class="process-why-card"><strong>Approvals are explicit</strong><span>Major decisions have clear checkpoints before the work moves forward.</span></div>
				<div class="process-why-card"><strong>Business context stays present</strong><span>Your team keeps technical work grounded in the real workflow.</span></div>
				<div class="process-why-card"><strong>Iteration is expected</strong><span>Review, refinement, testing, and retesting are built into the model.</span></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="process-success">
			<div>
				<p class="process-eyebrow">Success Together</p>
				<h2>Launch is the beginning of the partnership.</h2>
				<p>Agreement & roadmap → shared decisions → successful launch → continued improvement.</p>
			</div>
			<a href="/contact">Discuss Your Challenge</a>
		</section>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>